==Welsh==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|cy|/ɛχ/|a=standard}}
** {{IPA|cy|/χ(ː)/|a=informal}}

===Letter===
{{cy-letter|upper=Ch|lower=ch}}

# {{Latn-def|cy|letter|4|èch}} ''It is preceded by {{l|cy|C}} and followed by {{l|cy|D}}.''

====Usage notes====
Like the other Welsh digraphs, {{m|cy|Ch}} is considered a distinct letter of the Welsh alphabet for all purposes, including collation. Thus, {{m|cy|Chwilog}} is alphabetically sorted '''after''' {{m|cy|Cydweli}}.

===Mutation===
* {{m|cy|Ch}} cannot be mutated in Welsh.

